WEBVTT

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.620
Ret...

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.790
H-Hold on, Hoshino! Here?

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:29.330
You're the one who said it takes energy
to defeat the Kiseichuu, right?

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:32.370
So don't get the wrong idea.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:37.910
This isn't for your sake.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:40.950
It's for world peace.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.040
Super HxEROS episode two!

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.250
"HxEros Forms!"
Super HxEROS episode two!

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:35.200
I-I guess it was a dream.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.870
Oh, it's you, Runba.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.000
What's in your mouth?

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.790
Th-This is...

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.910
Runba! You can run, but you can't hide!

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.290
Momozono!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:57.370
Give me back my panties right now!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.910
Wh-What do you think you're going, Retto?

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:14.790
It wasn't me! Runba...

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.450
If you're a real man,
you'll get panties by yourself!

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.200
That's what she's mad about?

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:24.040
Sheesh. Boys these days have no courage.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.160
Jeez.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.160
She's so noisy.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.080
Tenkuji?

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:35.620
Retto, why were you sleeping in my room?

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.620
That's my line.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:41.540
You must have been half asleep
and stumbled in here again.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:44.950
Your room is over there.
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:03:55.870 --> 00:04:00.370
You've had an eventful morning, huh, Enjo?

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:02.120
Thanks, Shirayuki.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:05.870
You're the only decent person
in this house.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:10.080
That's not true. They're all good girls.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:25.580
Here, Runba. Breakfast!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.580
Oh, no. What a place for food to fall.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.330
Cut it out, Runba!
That's not your food bowl!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:49.330
I-I'm sorry to show you
such a shameful thing.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:53.410
I-It's okay. I didn't see anything.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:07.370
This house serves as the base
for the Super HxEROS team.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.830
My teammates and I all live together...

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.250
...except for one member.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:19.830
I can't tell you how pleased I am
that you found a new member.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.660
Now Super HxEROS can really get going.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.370
Um, I have a question.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:30.370
Is it really necessary to live together
just because we're a team?

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:33.830
Well, emergency deployment
is part and parcel of being a superhero,

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.870
and teamwork is all-important
to defeat bad guys.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.200
But still--

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.870
What's your name again, Pirara Hoshino?

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:45.910
It's Kirara.
And don't touch me.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:49.250
Well, we're birds of a feather,
so let's get along!

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:53.410
Birds of a feather?
I don't see how you get that.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:59.580
No, I agree with her.
You all have what it takes for this.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.870
We have what it takes?
What is that, exactly?

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.620
The ability to feel eros!

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.250
I'm going home!

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:22.120
I don't have time
to listen to this nonsense!

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.000
Wait!

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.200
What's she mad about?

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:34.410
What a waste.
She has such potential.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:41.080
Retto, can't you convince her?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:45.620
No, there's no way!
You saw Hoshino's response!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.000
I'm asking you, too!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.370
Whatever it takes, we need Pirara!

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:52.160
Momozono.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.450
Superheroes need five people on a team.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.750
Huh? That's the reason?

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:11.580
True, gathering members is important,
but Hoshino...

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.000
Taran!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.120
Taran! Taran! Taran!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.540
What?

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.000
Cosplay?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.290
Why is your skirt so short?

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.790
What do you care?

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.410
I must regulate you!

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:39.790
That'll do it!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.500
I hate long skirts!

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.620
That's as far as you go, Kiseichuu!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.450
Th-Thank you.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.410
Huh?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:06.120
Just the thought of making Hoshino
fight the Kiseichuu...

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:17.660
Th-That's so mean!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:20.830
I know, right?

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.080
What was that about?

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.080
Morning.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:24.950
Hey.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:27.250
The Iron Maiden was at it again.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:30.580
She just shot a guy down.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.910
H-Huh?

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.040
E-Enjo?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.500
Morning.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.200
W-Well, I have to get going!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:49.830
Get going? That's your locker.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.620
Did something happen, Retto?

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.950
Not especially.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:00.410
Oh, come on!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.120
That was about something.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.370
You're shady!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.120
The promise...

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:10.330
How about I help you
with what you do, Ret?

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:19.750
Th-That's only if you promise not to tell
anyone about what happened today.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.200
...from yesterday.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:27.200
No, that's not all, is it?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.620
Easy.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:41.910
Hoshino.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.120
Got a second?

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.620
Enjo.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:53.080
What do you want? You didn't tell anybody
about what happened yesterday, did you?

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:57.700
Of course not. That's why I waited
until I knew you'd be alone.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.700
Are you here to threaten me?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.330
Like I'd do that!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.160
Then what?

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.500
I was told to convince you...

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.500
But if you think about it,

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.000
making you fight the cause of your trauma
would be too cruel.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.120
N-Naturally!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:28.580
In the first place, why do you
go to the trouble of fighting them?

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:31.080
Sometimes I think...

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.410
...if we hadn't encountered
a Kiseichuu that day...

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:40.750
...maybe our relationship
would be different.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:46.290
And beyond us, the Kiseichuu have ruined
many other relationships, too.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:52.660
Whatever their reasons, I'll never
forgive them for stealing human emotions.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.160
Enjo...

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.540
My uncle may be disappointed
about losing you as a member...

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:02.950
...but I'll smooth it over with him,
so don't worry.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:06.040
Well, sorry to bother you.

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:16.540
What the heck?
Everyone thinks I've got a dirty mind.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:23.000
T-True, I can't deny that when
I was younger, I had certain urges, but...

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:34.620
That's right. I'm Jikochuu.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.580
Hey, did you know?

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:48.410
The heart beats three billion times
in a human lifetime.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:51.200
Let's try it out!

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:57.910
Want to see whose heart beats faster?

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.870
Sounds interesting.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.700
But I'm warning you, I won't lose!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.580
We'll see about that!

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:08.700
Okay, let's each put a hand
on the other's chest.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:10.700
Wait!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.580
There's no way!
I mean, that's just crazy!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.950
All right, fine.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:22.250
Then how about comparing by listening?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:33.040
Your heartbeat is getting faster, Ret.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:40.700
Huh?

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:44.870
This sound, it's the same as Ret's.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.200
I guess we tied today.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.370
Y-Yeah.

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:04.540
But I've changed.
I'm not the precocious girl I was then.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.950
M-Monster!

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.500
Monster?

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:18.870
D-Don't tell me one of those things
from yesterday has appeared at school.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:24.250
And beyond us, the Kiseichuu have ruined
many other relationships, too.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.660
So, this is what they call a school.

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:44.580
Perfect. It's full of young humans.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:51.160
Maybe I'll play here until the one who was rough
with my little sister this morning shows up.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.200
Hey!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:00.620
Sorry. You failed to escape.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:10.660
It looks like a broken heart
has filled you with negative H-energy.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.700
I can read you like a book.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:18.580
Oh, the indecent things
you imagined doing with that girl.

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:22.500
You put her in a swimsuit.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.450
Master.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:30.500
I want you to take me for a walk-woof!

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:38.700
I didn't have a choice.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.870
"FRIEND REQUEST"

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.830
P-Please be my friend!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.950
"COMPLETED DOWNLOADING
'SPEND A NIGHT AT AN INN
WITH SLENDER HOTTIE'"

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:52.410
A-Also, next time, let's go somewhere--

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.830
What right do you have to say that to me?

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.950
In the first place, who are you?

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:01.370
I would never give my contact info out
to someone I don't even know.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.660
I love her.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:09.290
I mean, I loved her!

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:12.450
But after she said that to me...

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.500
Have peace of mind.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:20.580
Once I absorb all of your H-energy...

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:25.450
...you'll never be burdened with love again.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:28.040
N-No, don't!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.910
What the heck is Enjo doing?

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.830
If he doesn't get here fast...

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:45.080
But that boy...

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:50.410
How you feel about it is of no consequence.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:52.410
D-Don't!

00:15:54.830 --> 00:16:01.200
Whatever their reasons, I'll never
forgive them for stealing human emotions.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:04.160
That's right.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:09.450
I must settle things with that boy myself!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.790
Stop!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:16.410
If you want to absorb someone's energy,
start with mine!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.200
What's this?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:23.790
A civilian standing up to me before
the Super HxEROS, even? That's a surprise.

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:33.790
Still, if you're so scared
that you're trembling,

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.620
why go to the trouble of defying me?

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:42.500
But I think I'll take you up
on your offer to absorb your energy.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.080
I told you, Kiseichuu.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:03.660
I'll never let your kind
touch Hoshino ever again!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:10.120
That's the first I've heard of it!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.410
E-Enjo.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:31.450
Hoshino! Why are your clothes gone, too?

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.950
You did it!

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:37.160
Sorry! I used too much strength
without thinking!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.750
What do we do about this?

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.370
Anyway, put something on from in here!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.660
Guard, hurry!
There's a monster over here!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.450
We have to hide, Hoshino!

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.250
Come on! It's right here!

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.580
I don't see anything.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:54.950
Huh?

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.540
It was right here.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:03.040
Don't make any noise.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.660
Easy for him to say.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:11.580
When our naked bodies are
right up against each other like this...

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:17.540
No good! My heart is beating fast.

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.620
I'm sure Enjo can hear it!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:25.700
And this time,
my heart is the one that's beating faster!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.290
I swear it was right here.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.660
Well, let's take a look over there.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.160
They finally left.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.120
My heart is still beating a little fast.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.660
What the heck was I thinking?

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:53.330
I don't want to admit
that I "have what it takes."

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.450
But...

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:05.870
If it means I get to be with him
like old times...

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:11.500
Fine.
If you need me that badly, I'll join.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:16.830
That Super HxEROS thing.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.700
Wh-Why so sudden?

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:23.290
Why? Because I don't forgive
the Kiseichuu, either!

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:24.620
I see.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:29.120
But there will be no using me
to accumulate your energy!

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:31.200
Of course,
that goes for the other girls, too!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:34.950
I-I'll see what I can do.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:42.830
But, i-if we're in a very serious situation
where it becomes necessary...

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.250
What did I just get done saying?

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:02.000
I-I'll try to comply, but...

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:06.080
And what were you starting to say just now?

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.160
I refuse to say it again!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:21.750
H-Hey. What were you
talking to that boy about?

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.750
Who knows?

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:27.160
Never mind that. Let's get going.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.330
Where to?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.790
"EARTH DEFENSE FORCE
SAITAMA BRANCH
LODGING HOUSE"

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.830
"EARTH DEFENSE FORCE
SAITAMA BRANCH
LODGING HOUSE"
Your house.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:34.830
So...

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.410
I look forward
to getting to know all of you.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:41.450
Oh, this is great! I was worried.

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:44.290
In the end,
birds of a feather flock together.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:47.200
Don't say that, Sora.

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:50.250
That includes you, too, Maihime!

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:53.790
For now,
us girls will give you the grand tour.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.160
The sole male can wait quietly
in his room 'til we're done.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:57.370
Wait a--

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:58.830
Okay, okay.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.290
What a day.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:10.200
Still, I can't believe
Hoshino is joining the Super HxEROS.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.540
Huh? Then that means...

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.660
...from today, I'll be living together
with the girl I love?

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:19.000
Emergency alert! Emergency alert!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:23.830
A giant Kiseichuu has appeared
in the metropolitan area!

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:26.500
All members,
please mobilize immediately!

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:51.700
Wh-Why are all of you naked?

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:55.370
Well, since we're going to be
teammates from now on,

00:21:55.370 --> 00:22:00.080
I thought taking a group bath
would help us bond.

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:01.910
H-Hoshino?

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:09.290
I hate this place, after all!

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:49.410
Super HxEROS!

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:51.910
Next time: Butterfly Effect!
